                                "sense_id": "ab22b248-e31a-332d-a4fa-be0998ed81b5",
                                "text": "Teugh, adj. (Pr. of the eu much as in Teuflt). Tough.\n\"With cordes enewe and ropys Teugh\nThe Jues felle my limmes out-droghe\nFor that I was not mete enoghe\nUnto the bore\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82470844-1392-4b11-a5b1-4012b72a8278",
                                "sense_id": "ab22b248-e31a-332d-a4fa-be0998ed81b5",
                                "text": "A dialectical (Scottish) form of tough.\n\"Unco thick in the soles, as ye may weel mind, forbye being teugh in the upper-leather.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
